ment features a classic column-wheel design and an inner soft-iron case to protect it from magnetic fields. This multi-functional sports watch is water-resistant to 10 bar and comes with the IWC EasyX-CHANGE® strap changing system, allowing for quick and easy strap changes without additional tools. Movement: Automatic movement Water resistance: 10 bar Case color: Black Case diameter: 41.9mm','https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/28e5611b-6a64-4a50-942e-9d4e63941752.jpg','IWC Pilot\'s Watch Topgun Ceramic Titanium Chronograph 41',NULL,458,'[{\"id\":\"2026-02091000\",\"specs\":{\"Type\":\"simple\"},\"price\":458.0,\"originalPrice\":null,\"stock\":100,\"enabled\":true}]','[{\"name\":\"Type\",\"options\":[\"simple\"]}]','on',NULL,'IWC',NULL,'175849','iwc',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-21 02:07:41.869753','[\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/a464645f-5f74-491f-b520-d71e6a00985a.jpg\",\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/28e5611b-6a64-4a50-942e-9d4e63941752.jpg\",\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/0bd99284-4a63-40ae-804c-556103ca850a.jpg\",\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/5afe6c6a-ce5e-45a6-be27-92180fe6e374.jpg\",\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ea4940cb-4079-49e4-8197-842149469dc8.jpg\"]'),('wc-175857','replica-watch','Replica Watch','The IWC Portuguese Tourbillon Retrograde Date Chronograph IW394008 features a 43.5mm diameter, 15.9mm thickness, platinum case, 12 diamond hour markers, black dial, and a matching fabric strap. It is powered by the 89900 movement, a high-end member of IWC&#8217;s current four flagship in-house movement families—the 89000 flyback chronograph series (which integrates flyback chronograph, retrograde date, and flying minute tourbillon functions), with an 18K red gold rotor.','https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ab19a1bf8777f01167c4456ae84b70dd.jpg','IWC Tourbillon Mechanical Watch',NULL,1585,'[{\"id\":\"202602092000\",\"specs\":{\"Type\":\"simple\"},\"price\":1585.0,\"originalPrice\":null,\"stock\":100,\"enabled\":true}]','[{\"name\":\"Type\",\"options\":[\"simple\"]}]','on',NULL,'IWC',NULL,'175857','iwc',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-21 02:07:41.857881','[\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/d53760bee61db0bec5ee26fec42cdb2f.jpg\",\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ab19a1bf8777f01167c4456ae84b70dd.jpg\"]'),('wc-175987','replica-watch','Replica Watch','Core Specifications **Movement:** Powered by Breitling&#8217;s in-house Caliber 20, an automatic mechanical movement with approximately 70 hours of power reserve, ensuring accurate timekeeping and long battery life. **Case:** The stainless steel case measures 44mm in diameter and 14mm in thickness, a standard pilot&#8217;s watch size that provides a substantial presence on the wrist. **Water Resistance:** Water resistant to 200 meters, making it suitable for everyday use and water activities such as swimming and surfing. **Crystal:** Features a domed sapphire crystal with double anti-reflective coating, offering high hardness and effectively reducing light reflection for crystal-clear dial visibility. **Dial:** The classic &#8220;panda dial&#8221; design features a striking black and white contrast for excellent legibility, a signature look of the aviator chronograph series. **Strap:** Paired with a robust stainless steel bracelet that complements the case material, creating a unified overall style.','https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/1b4ac8fe3938605bb463748a6a7bb15b.jpeg','Breitling A4531012.G751.739P.A20BA.1, 43mm case diameter.',NULL,568,'[{\"id\":\"wc-175987-simple\",\"specs\":{\"Type\":\"simple\"},\"price\":568.0,\"originalPrice\":null,\"stock\":100,\"enabled\":true}]','[{\"name\":\"Type\",\"options\":[\"simple\"]}]','on',NULL,'Breitling',NULL,'175987','wc-brand-breitling',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-21 10:47:55.222640','[\"https://www.manggata.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/69d8b8e9ec1fea7597b4dddcaabd5